 **Extract Quantitative Comparisons (if any):**\n    - The question doesn't ask for numerical comparisons between groups, but the materials contain numbers for Phase I/II trials. However, the prompt says: \"quantitative_comparisons 记录原文给出的统计量（没报告才留空）... 一组一数成对...\". Since the core question is about the *existence* of Phase III RCTs, and the materials are Phase I/II or reviews, I will list the quantitative data from the Phase I/II trials only if they are directly relevant to distinguishing the studies, but the prompt emphasizes extracting them per group. Actually, the instruction says: \"先完成 quantitative_comparisons，再写 usable_content。必须先逐组读原句...\". I will extract the key metrics from the Phase I/II trials mentioned, clearly labeling them as such, to show what data *is* available versus what is missing (Phase III). But since the question is purely about Phase III existence, I might just set `quantitative_comparisons` to `[]` or include the Phase I/II data with clear labels to contrast. Let's stick to the instruction: extract if present. I'll list the Phase I/II trial results separately to avoid confusion, but note they don't fulfill the Phase III criterion. Actually, the prompt says \"涉及数字时，先逐项输出 quantitative_comparisons\". I will extract the reported stats from the Phase I/II trials as requested, but clearly state they are not Phase III.\n    - Let's carefully format `quantitative_comparisons` according to the schema: `[\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"...\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"...\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"...\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"...\",\n        \"value\": \"...\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]`\n    - From Material 2/3 (FMT-LUMINate, Phase II):\n      - Research object: Advanced cutaneous melanoma pts receiving FMT + dual ICI (ipilimumab/nivolumab)\n      - Result/measure: ORR, Grade >3 irAE rate, sST2 levels, p-values for clustering\n      - Setting/time: Phase II trial, median follow-up 6 months\n      - Groups: Responders (R) vs Non-responders (NR) post-FMT; Colitis vs No colitis\n      - Values: ORR 70% (CR 2, PR 12); Grade >3 irAE 65%; sST2 higher in colitis group (p<0.05); beta-diversity clustering p=0.024; mouse tumor control p<0.005\n    - From Material 4/5 (MIMic, Phase I):\n      - Research object: Advanced melanoma pts receiving oral FMT + anti-PD1\n      - Result/measure: ORR, mPFS, mOS\n      - Setting/time: Phase I single-arm trial, median follow-up >3 years (min 40 mo)\n      - Groups: N/A (single-arm)\n      - Values: ORR 65%, mPFS 29.6 months, mOS 52.8 months\n    - I will structure these carefully. Since the question is about Phase III, I'll note that these are Phase I/II data. The prompt says \"一组一数成对，不用多组名字对应一串数字；总体与分层比较、不同指标或结果分别记录。\" I'll create separate entries for different measures.\n\n    Let's draft `quantitative_comparisons`:\n    ```json\n    [\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"Advanced cutaneous melanoma patients receiving FMT + dual ICI (ipilimumab/nivolumab)\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"Objective response rate (ORR)\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"Phase II trial (FMT-LUMINate), median follow-up 6 months\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"Overall cohort (n=20)\",\n        \"value\": \"70% (2 CR, 12 PR)\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"Advanced cutaneous melanoma patients receiving FMT + dual ICI\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"Grade >3 immune-related adverse events (irAEs)\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"Phase II trial (FMT-LUMINate), median follow-up 6 months\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        \"group\": \"Overall cohort (n=20)\",\n        \"value\": \"65%\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"research_object\": \"Advanced cutaneous melanoma patients receiving FMT + dual ICI\",\n    \"result_or_measure\": \"Microbiome beta-diversity clustering (Responders vs Non-responders)\",\n    \"setting_or_time\": \"Phase II trial (FMT-LUMINate), post-FMT metagenomic sequencing\",\n    \"groups\": [\n      {\n        