se III RCTs have confirmed reproducible survival benefits, identifying this as a critical field gap. Ongoing efforts focus on Phase I/Ib trials (FMT, defined consortia like SER-401, engineered live biotherapeutics) and face regulatory/safety hurdles.\n    - Ensure tone matches academic synthesis. Do not overgeneralize. Keep distinction between Phase I/II findings and the Phase III question clear.\n\n    Draft:\n    基于现有文献材料，截至2025年末至2026年发表的系统性综述明确指出，目前尚无完成的、针对实体瘤患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗期间联合微生态干预（如FMT、益生菌或定义菌群）的III期随机对照试验（RCT），亦无此类大样本随机设计下报告主要疗效终点（OS/PFS/ORR）的已发表数据。当前证据层级主要由I期和II期单臂或早期阶段研究构成：例如MIMic I期试验（n=20，口服FMT联合抗PD-1）报告了客观缓解率（ORR）65%、中位无进展生存期（mPFS）29.6个月及中位总生存期（mOS）52.8个月，但作者明确强调其样本量小且缺乏对照组，属假设生成性数据；FMT-LUMINate II期试验（n=20，口服FMT联合双靶点ICI）显示ORR达70%，并观察到应答者与非应答者治疗后微生物β多样性显著分层（p=0.024）及特定菌属（如Prevotella copri、Ruminoccocaceae）富集，同时伴随较高的3级以上免疫相关不良事件发生率（65%）。这些早期研究为微生态调节机制（如短链脂肪酸产生菌丰度变化、上皮完整性标志物sST2水平关联）提供了生物学依据，并支撑了后续开展随机对照研究的合理性，但其单臂设计与有限随访无法替代III期RCT的因果推断效力。因此，现有材料直接证实了该领域在高级别临床证据上的空白，未来验证需依赖正在规划或进行中的I/Ib期试验（如SER-401、SYNB1891等工程活体生物疗法）逐步推进至确证性随机阶段。\n\n6.  **Check against Constraints:**\n    - `quantitative_comparisons`: Formatted correctly, extracts numbers per group/result, separates Phase I/II data clearly.\n    - `usable_content`: Directly answers the question first. Distinguishes studies. Explains meaning without repeating numbers verbatim. Notes limitations (single-arm, small n). Matches reading mode. No causal overreach. Preserves distinctions.\n    - `decision`: `direct_use` because the review explicitly confirms absence, satisfying the success criterion.\n    - `still_missing`: None required for the direct question, but could note that real-time registry checks beyond 2025 cutoff aren't covered by these texts. I'll leave it empty or note minimal.\n    - `read_focus`: Not needed for direct_use.\n    - `external_ask`: Not needed.\n    - `reason`: Explains why direct_use is chosen (review explicitly states absence, materials only contain Phase I/II data, directly ad